# chat-playground is a desktop (Electron) demo: it runs the local Coding Agent
# runtime (@percena/weft-node) in the Electron main process. No remote URL, no
# backend server. Claude/Codex run locally on this machine.
#
# Real agent turns require local provider auth:
#   - Claude: `claude` CLI logged in, or @anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk installed.
#   - Codex: `codex` CLI on PATH and logged in (codex app-server account/read).
#
# Nothing to configure here by default — settings (provider / cwd / permission
# mode / reasoning effort) come from the in-app panel.
